{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So I'm looking at, what exactly?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establishing some useful terminology and expanding on ideas covered in Masahiro Sakurai's video explanation of this topic, Frame Sense Trainer is a game with exercises, tutorials, examples, and tools useful to honing what this software will refer to as \u201cFrame Sense\u201d, or rather, \u201cTemporal Frame Estimation\u201d (TFE) if technical terms are preferred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What does Frame Sense Trainer have to offer?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools for frame duration visualization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials for learning to hone TFE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ranked leader board for exercises of various difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Okay but like, who asked?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I did! I couldn't find software for doing this so I decided to make it myself.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841260?t=1770521140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841260/51bbfd21a609876f151c74d71dd0e242f04e2f9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770521140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841260/09409f8b9e3a2be9e3e9dfb2c60c80401420f926/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770521140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841260/09409f8b9e3a2be9e3e9dfb2c60c80401420f926/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770521140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4131210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So I'm looking at, what exactly?</h2><p class